msgstr "Anthropic (Claude) API anahtarı"

msgid ""
"console.anthropic.com › API Keys. Claude models are listed with the "
"\"claude:\" prefix."
msgstr ""
"console.anthropic.com › API Keys. Claude modelleri \"claude:\" önekiyle "
"listelenir."

msgid "Anthropic workspace ID"
msgstr "Anthropic workspace ID"

msgid ""
"Only needed when the key is not tied to a workspace (if the error asks for "
"\"anthropic-workspace-id\")."
msgstr ""
"Yalnız anahtar bir workspace'e bağlı değilse gerekir (hata mesajı "
"\"anthropic-workspace-id\" isterse)."

